cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UNITE in your research, please cite the accompanying paper and software release."
title: "UNITE: A Modular Testbed for Reproducible Delayed Space Teleoperation"
abstract: >-
  UNITE is a source-available modular Unity testbed for human-in-the-loop mobile-robot
  teleoperation under communication delay. It represents communication conditions,
  operator input, feedback, vehicle behavior, assistance techniques, tasks,
  environments, and data capture as independently configurable modules.
